ocument structure, scan quality, installed Microsoft Office components, and device performance. OCR output can contain errors. Customers are responsible for reviewing files marked for attention and verifying results before using them for billing, legal, or contractual decisions."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Availability and updates"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The service requires Windows 10 or Windows 11 (64-bit), a supported Microsoft Word desktop installation for Word-document counting, and sufficient local storage. Internet access is required for the first sign-in, account validation, support, and updates. Document processing runs locally on the customer's computer. Features, supported formats, and technical requirements may change to improve reliability or security."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Subscriptions and cancellation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"When public subscriptions are enabled, the plan, price, billing frequency, renewal terms, and any applicable taxes will be presented before payment. A subscription will renew only on the schedule shown at checkout until it is cancelled. Customers will be able to request cancellation through the customer billing portal or by contacting support. Cancellation stops the next renewal and access normally remains available through the end of the already paid billing period."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Acceptable use"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Users must have the right to process every document they select and must not use the software for unlawful content, unauthorised access, infringement, or attempts to disrupt the service."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":["$L7","$L8"]}],"$L9"]}],"$La"]}]]
